# Allowlist: ignore everything, then let in only what the image needs.
# This keeps .env, private/, artifacts/, tests and docs out of the build.
*
!Dockerfile
!harness/
!model/model_gateway/
!mcp/kpi-solar/kpi_solar/
!mcp/actions/actions/
!tools/kpi-lab/server.py
!tools/kpi-lab/index.html
!tools/kpi-lab/charts.js
!tools/kpi-lab/config.js
**/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
